| EEGNet | 0.5228 | 0.5118 | 0.3637 |
| FBCNet | 0.4402 | 0.4215 | 0.2536 |
| DeepConvNet | 0.4371 | 0.3783 | 0.2495 |
| MSFBCNN | 0.3893 | 0.3854 | 0.1857 |

Historical Protocol 2 result directory:
results/protocol2_loso_te_train_eval_window_0p5_4p5_band_5_30hz

| Model | Accuracy | F1-macro | Kappa |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| FBCNet | 0.4155 | 0.3957 | 0.2207 |
| ShallowConvNet | 0.4090 | 0.3688 | 0.2119 |
| EEGNet | 0.4024 | 0.3539 | 0.2032 |
| DeepConvNet | 0.3981 | 0.3516 | 0.1975 |
| MSFBCNN | 0.3673 | 0.3377 | 0.1564 |

Interpretation:

- ShallowConvNet and EEGNet were strongest under the historical 5-30Hz Protocol 1.
- FBCNet was strongest under the historical 5-30Hz strict Protocol 2.
- Protocol 2 performance is lower than Protocol 1, showing clear cross-subject
  domain shift.
- Difficult target subjects under Protocol 2 include A07E, A05E, and A02E.

